# One step of following Mottek: the client walks at his side and answers what he says. The host keeps up behind him
# (teleports, no walking), so every walk-up talk on the way goes to the client alone and nobody runs ahead into the
# next NPC.
B tpnear $m 45 0
A tpnear $m -120 20
B walk -1 0 1
sleep 3
B skip first
